<node id="1171473" title="GRUB Append Parameter in-between Quotes" created="2016-09-09 12:46:38" updated="2016-09-09 12:46:38" _doctext_mode="lenient"><type id="115">perlquestion</type>
<author id="713401">ephemeric</author>
<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;p&gt;                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            
Hi,                                                                             
                                                                                
I would like to append a parameter "transparent_hugepage=never" to the below regex matched line in-between the quotes. On subsequent runs the substitution should be ignored to maintain idempotence (run as an Ansible playbook task). I tried a few things but failed as my knowledge is very limited.
                                                                                
Thank you for your help and pardon my poor articulation.                        
                                                                                
Line in question:                                                               
&lt;/p&gt;                                                                            
                                                                                
&lt;code&gt;GRUB_CMDLINE_LINUX="crashkernel=auto rd.lvm.lv=centos/root rd.lvm.lv=centos/swap rhgb quiet"&lt;/code&gt;
                                                                                
&lt;p&gt;                                                                             
The sed keeps appending after repeating the play as I can't get the negative lookahead assertion to work, I think that's what it is? 
&lt;/p&gt;                                                                            
                                                                                
&lt;code&gt;sed '/^GRUB_CMDLINE_LINUX=.*/ s/\(.*\)"/\1 transparent_hugepage=never"/' $line&lt;/code&gt;
                                                                                
&lt;p&gt;                                                                             
And this from the playbook appends after the last quote breaking the config:       
&lt;/p&gt;                                                                            
                                                                                
&lt;code&gt;                                                                          
replace:                                                                        
backup: yes                                                                     
dest: /etc/default/grub                                                         
regexp: '(^GRUB_CMDLINE_LINUX(?!.*\btransparent_hugepage=never\b).*)$'          
replace: '\1 transparent_hugepage=never"'                                       
&lt;/code&gt;</doctext>
